---
// CTA section - final call to action, Linear-inspired with dramatic background
---

<section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <!-- Dramatic radial gradient orb behind CTA -->
  <div class="cta-bg-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cta-bg-orb-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2 id="cta-heading" class="cta-title heading-glow">
        Empieza a gestionar<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">tu dinero hoy</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-subtitle">
        Gratuito, sin anuncios, sin acceso a tus datos bancarios. Solo tú y el control total de tus finanzas.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://wallet-wise.devcodewolf.com" class="btn-primary btn-lg" rel="noopener">
          Empezar gratis
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14"/>
            <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/devcodewolf/WalletWise" class="btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          Ver en GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 7rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Primary dramatic orb */
  .cta-bg-orb {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 800px;
    height: 800px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--color-glow) 0%, rgba(52,211,153,0.05) 30%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(80px);
    opacity: 0.6;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: pulse-glow 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* Secondary cyan orb for depth */
  .cta-bg-orb-secondary {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(6,182,212,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(90px);
    opacity: 0.4;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: pulse-glow 6s ease-in-out infinite 3s;
  }

  .cta-card {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-glow), transparent 55%);
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw + 0.5rem, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cta-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 0.8125rem 2.25rem;
    font-size: 0.96875rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta {
      padding: 3.5rem 1rem 5rem;
    }
    .cta-card {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
